{"type":"json_object","message":"The requested net change is the Dec 27, 2008 ending balance of unrecognized tax benefits minus the Dec 29, 2007 ending balance. I use the reconciliation table amounts: 2008 ending balance = $214.4 million (source:t8c1n0) and 2007 ending balance = $126.6 million (source:t8c2n0). Both are already in $ millions, so the difference is in USD millions.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"ending_2008 - ending_2007","variables":{"ending_2008":{"value":214.4,"source":"source:t8c1n0","unit":"USD_million"},"ending_2007":{"value":126.6,"source":"source:t8c2n0","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"ending_2008":"source:t8c1n0","ending_2007":"source:t8c2n0"}}}